{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Neolithic Dawn - the ultimate survival experience! </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of a Stone Age Hunter-Gatherer and struggle to survive in the harsh wilderness of 10,000 BC.                                               </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018960/extras/b0d58b2587f9253b240c9b99b3abf636.poster.avif?t=1770714958\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018960/extras/b0d58b2587f9253b240c9b99b3abf636.webm?t=1770714958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018960/extras/b0d58b2587f9253b240c9b99b3abf636.mp4?t=1770714958\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc3a Tame Anything</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Any animal you encounter can become a powerful ally - choose your battles by feeding animals to tame them instead!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc6f\u200d\u2642\ufe0f Up to 4 Player CO-OP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even more fun when you bring your tribe and face the wilderness together, with up to 4 players in private CO-OP games with friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018960/extras/761a2daf7aa5b7bb606501400ee10c0c.poster.avif?t=1770714958\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018960/extras/761a2daf7aa5b7bb606501400ee10c0c.webm?t=1770714958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018960/extras/761a2daf7aa5b7bb606501400ee10c0c.mp4?t=1770714958\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\ude93 Physics-Based Crafting</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft whatever you can out of what you find. Find new combinations of tools and weapons when you combine sticks, rocks, and bones with your own two hands in true caveman fashion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018960/extras/71d86ed1d45657afb2bd46c0d1cfd1ae.poster.avif?t=1770714958\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018960/extras/71d86ed1d45657afb2bd46c0d1cfd1ae.webm?t=1770714958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018960/extras/71d86ed1d45657afb2bd46c0d1cfd1ae.mp4?t=1770714958\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc80Generational Permadeath</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death is a new beginning - return as the next member of your lineage to a version of the world that has been permanently altered by time.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf0e Living World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a real-time day night cycle, dynamic seasons, and generational changes as you explore 5 large open world maps each with its own unique dungeon and campsites to explore and build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We thank you for your support of this project, and are excited to end Early Access and start a new chapter where we will continue to update and expand the world of Neolithic Dawn in version 1.0!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Also Featuring:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Impossible World</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Neolithic Dawn Take place in a recreation of a real world location with a secret world to uncover. Learn the ways of the past, reconnect with your ancestors, and discover the supernatural beauty of a fallen civilization.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Up to 4 Player CO-OP</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even more fun when you bring your friends and face the wilderness together! Meet new people in the social Campfire Hangout mode or Journey through through the story together in CO-OP with friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Neolithic Dawn is built by a small team with a big dream. By launching in Early Access we hope to finish building the game alongside the community so we can build the greatest VR survival game together! \ud83d\udcaa</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Star Seeker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2018960/395b3b5e3b1bfcfe433186ee54850b6a066605cb.jpg"},{"name":"Tower of Terror","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2018960/e8c54a89c7319a112f2bffa60f7c057f9485175e.jpg"},{"name":"We Have Technology","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2018960/66583c046cc9eba9a9ec5c4820c9432d257fb40c.jpg"},{"name":"Meat Lover","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2018960/a1175c3ed005b7759d4e6e25e4b12982f3c43911.jpg"},{"name":"Vegetarian","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2018960/56ef182c06993b60f52fbbe2ced26ff801da65e9.jpg"},{"name":"Pescatarian","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2018960/186b9061e2d8e8c0f70bc95b6f6a7d74d262448b.jpg"},{"name":"In Your Ancestors Footsteps","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2018960/7dacd1d2308495794ab23f5c50a455c101d0eb79.jpg"},{"name":"Hydro Homie","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2018960/71f06b358b89c5f3810bc7acd0a485992b7b603a.jpg"},{"name":"Won't be Needing That","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2018960/0172105afd0938b4b9801120ae6b328f9d084149.jpg"},{"name":"Birds of a Feather","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2018960/b754d68a8b03b1c4e3c5c37d4db537683c2244e7.jpg"}],"total":12},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2018960?t=1770714958","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018960/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770714958","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018960/2c00b5251f37318fdb74bc33eee130599688158b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770714958","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018960/2c00b5251f37318fdb74bc33eee130599688158b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770714958","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Neolithic Dawn - the ultimate survival experience! </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of a Stone Age Hunter-Gatherer and struggle to survive in the harsh wilderness of 10,000 BC.                                               </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018960/extras/b0d58b2587f9253b240c9b99b3abf636.poster.avif?t=1770714958\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018960/extras/b0d58b2587f9253b240c9b99b3abf636.webm?t=1770714958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018960/extras/b0d58b2587f9253b240c9b99b3abf636.mp4?t=1770714958\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc3a Tame Anything</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Any animal you encounter can become a powerful ally - choose your battles by feeding animals to tame them instead!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc6f\u200d\u2642\ufe0f Up to 4 Player CO-OP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even more fun when you bring your tribe and face the wilderness together, with up to 4 players in private CO-OP games with friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018960/extras/761a2daf7aa5b7bb606501400ee10c0c.poster.avif?t=1770714958\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018960/extras/761a2daf7aa5b7bb606501400ee10c0c.webm?t=1770714958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018960/extras/761a2daf7aa5b7bb606501400ee10c0c.mp4?t=1770714958\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\ude93 Physics-Based Crafting</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft whatever you can out of what you find. Find new combinations of tools and weapons when you combine sticks, rocks, and bones with your own two hands in true caveman fashion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018960/extras/71d86ed1d45657afb2bd46c0d1cfd1ae.poster.avif?t=1770714958\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018960/extras/71d86ed1d45657afb2bd46c0d1cfd1ae.webm?t=1770714958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018960/extras/71d86ed1d45657afb2bd46c0d1cfd1ae.mp4?t=1770714958\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc80Generational Permadeath</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death is a new beginning - return as the next member of your lineage to a version of the world that has been permanently altered by time.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf0e Living World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a real-time day night cycle, dynamic seasons, and generational changes as you explore 5 large open world maps each with its own unique dungeon and campsites to explore and build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We thank you for your support of this project, and are excited to end Early Access and start a new chapter where we will continue to update and expand the world of Neolithic Dawn in version 1.0!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Also Featuring:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Impossible World</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Neolithic Dawn Take place in a recreation of a real world location with a secret world to uncover. Learn the ways of the past, reconnect with your ancestors, and discover the supernatural beauty of a fallen civilization.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Up to 4 Player CO-OP</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even more fun when you bring your friends and face the wilderness together! Meet new people in the social Campfire Hangout mode or Journey through through the story together in CO-OP with friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Neolithic Dawn is built by a small team with a big dream. By launching in Early Access we hope to finish building the game alongside the community so we can build the greatest VR survival game together! \ud83d\udcaa</p>","developers":["Neolithic LLC"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018960/e07c33128389986e62d1ab3b522fca070860ebb9/header_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1770714958","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\"NEOLITHIC DAWN\" is a trademark of Neolithic LLC","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2018960/1483471965/50611c82feb492a7d1427cab68719bcf80a2d1ac/1765476419/dash_av1.mpd?t=1765492542","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2018960/1483471965/50611c82feb492a7d1427cab68719bcf80a2d1ac/1765476419/dash_h264.mpd?t=1765492542","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steams