1a7/ss_c68075446a616fdacafddc01327c3feb6c83d1a7.1920x1080.jpg?t=1770714958","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018960/c68075446a616fdacafddc01327c3feb6c83d1a7/ss_c68075446a616fdacafddc01327c3feb6c83d1a7.600x338.jpg?t=1770714958"}],"short_description":"Fight, Hunt, Craft, and Tame to Survive in this prehistoric Adventure build exclusively for Virtual Reality. Uncover an Ice Age Civilization. Build a better World for your Descendants. Welcome to 10,000 BC, Cave Man! Your Tribe is Waiting.","steam_appid":2018960,"support_info":{"email":"support@neolithicsurvivalgame.com","url":"https://discord.com/invite/86JKmRQgbh"},"supported_languages":"English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Simplified Chinese, Ukrainian, Russian","type":"game","website":"https://www.neolithicsurvivalgame.com"}